-- title:
--   UBV original stopped martingale witnesses give integrable real perpetual cash and exact ENNReal value
-- statement:
--   Uniform original positive natural-horizon UBV stopped clocks with genuine postpayment or ruin reserve, closed Stieltjes cash, source terminal, integrable centred martingale and integrable nonpositive drift/remainder witness terms imply a finite genuine dividendValue via the Proved LIMIT-1 UBV source-to-value theorem. HJB max yields the required slope bound. The Proved original finite-value signed Stieltjes theorem then establishes integrability of the full untruncated real discounted dividend-measure integral and its exact expected value identity with the ENNReal perpetual dividendValue. This avoids equality-in-law and terminal vanishing, preserving zero and closed-horizon atoms.

